        <object label="&lt;b&gt;PER-TURN PIPELINE — complete, in code order · benchmark.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 cache.lookup — HIT ⇒ cost 0, 2ms, continue&lt;br&gt;2 summarizeHistory — no-op unless &amp;gt;4 msgs; prompt swap&lt;br&gt;3 classifyComplexity → routeToModel — tier chosen&lt;br&gt;4 simulateLLMCall — the only token spend in the loop&lt;br&gt;5 applyEarlyTermination — cost × (0.5 + 0.5·ratio)&lt;br&gt;6 perceivedLatency — TTFT replaces total latency&lt;br&gt;7 cache.store — every miss is written back&lt;br&gt;README&#x27;s ASCII draws compression 1st; the code checks the cache 1st." class="card.invariant" id="card_pipe">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#3F51B5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="320" y="448" width="456" height="136" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;MODEL TIERS — all three, complete · MODEL_PRICING baseline.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;frontier · gpt-4 · $0.03 in / $0.06 out per 1K&lt;br&gt;mid · claude-sonnet · $0.003 / $0.015 per 1K&lt;br&gt;cheap · gpt-4o-mini · $0.00015 / $0.0006 per 1K&lt;br&gt;latency 800/400/200ms base + 15/8/5ms per token, jitter&lt;br&gt;routeToModel — simple→cheap, medium→mid, complex→frontier&lt;br&gt;TTFT floor 300/150/100ms feeds perceivedLatency" class="card.primitive" id="card_tiers">
